  "id": "patient-violence",
  "term": "patient violence",
  "definition": "Patient violence refers to violent incidents carried out by patients, discussed here as an outcome measured by how often such incidents occur in psychiatric forensic ward settings. Reported rates can be influenced by contextual factors such as staff features, treatment programs, assessment practices, and administrative organization.",
